 "version": 1,
 "description": "R5/S2 ratchet baseline (check-application-door-surfaces.mjs): exact value+type export surfaces of every application door (any-depth index.ts) plus the production application root-file set. Widening, shrinking, an unregistered new door/nested barrel/root barrel/root file, a deleted door, or a wildcard export (export * / export * as ns) all FAIL. Deliberate surface changes update this file in the same PR with a dated note.",
 "notes": {
  "unconsumed-type-symbols": "Six doors carry exactly one type symbol without a live door consumer (the service type): parties, activity, financial-pulse, follow-up, cost, estimates — pinned as-is (R5 ledger §1); trimming is a surface change reserved for a later wave.",
  "r10b-nf003-theme-preference-door-type": "2026-10-11 (R10-B3/R10B-NF-003): preferences type surface +ThemePreference — the canonical theme-preference type consumed by contexts/ThemeContext.tsx (type-only import) after deleting its local re-declaration; same-PR documented widening per PC-3.",
  "r10b-f004-capability-id-door": "2026-10-11 (R10-B3/R10A-F-004): preferences door +type CapabilityId +value isKnownCapabilityId — canonical capability-id declaration consolidated to the persistence owner; UI consumers (hook re-export, Settings) narrow explicitly instead of unsound casts; same-PR documented widening per PC-3.",
  "r10b-nf001-payment-source-door": "2026-10-12 (R10-B3/R10B-NF-001): finance door +value PAYMENT_SOURCE_UNSET +value resolveDefaultPaymentSource — the sentinel and the 0/1/multi-wallet default rule consolidated to their canonical owner application/finance/paymentSourcePolicy.ts; the UI consumer (components/finance/expenseFormModel) imports through the door per STR-615/R6 (no deep UI-to-application imports); same-PR documented widening per PC-3.",
  "r10b-nf002-inventory-unit-label-door": "2026-10-12 (R10-B3/R10B-NF-002): inventory door +value materialUnitLabel — the Arabic MaterialUnit display mapping consolidated to its canonical owner application/inventory/materialUnitLabels.ts after deleting six per-surface copies (2 application + 4 pages); the UI consumers import through the door per STR-615/R6; same-PR documented widening per PC-3."
 },
